sequenceDiagram
    participant Server as MCP Server
    participant Introspect as Introspection
    participant Factory as Tool Factory
    participant FastMCP as FastMCP
    participant Store as Tool Registry
    
    Server->>Introspect: Load schema (SDL or endpoint)
    Introspect->>Introspect: Parse & normalize
    Introspect-->>Factory: Schema<EntityDef>
    
    Factory->>Factory: For each entity
    Factory->>Factory: Generate get_*, create_*, update_*
    Factory->>Factory: Build JSON schema for args
    Factory->>Store: Register via mcp.add_tool()
    
    Factory->>Factory: Generate entity map
    Factory-->>Server: (Inject into system prompt)
    
    Server-->>Store: Ready to receive tool calls
